{"id":39651,"date":"2025-01-12T18:50:58","date_gmt":"2025-01-12T17:50:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=39651"},"modified":"2026-08-24T10:10:26","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T09:10:26","slug":"trail-nascente-e-vale-do-neiva-2025-2","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-nascente-e-vale-do-neiva-2025-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Nascente e Vale do Neiva 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A RIBEITRAIL e o Grupo Desportivo e Recreativo da Ribeira do Neiva tem a honra de anunciar a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o o V Trail Nascente e Vale do Neiva 2025.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O IV Trail Nascente e Vale do Neiva pretende promover o desporto, a sa\u00fade e o bem-estar das popula\u00e7\u00f5es, e ter\u00e1 lugar no dia 27 de Abril de 2025, incluindo uma Caminhada com 10km, um Trail Curto com 17km e um Trail Longo com 31 km.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2025, a n\u00edvel de competi\u00e7\u00e3o, o Trail insere-se na ATRP no Circuito Nacional de Trail e de Trail Sprint ambos de s\u00e9rie 100.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":39652,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[52,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-39651","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-verde-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/e0cc.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajd